WEBVTT

00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:09.926
A NETFLIX SERIES

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:14.180
TONOSAMAN

00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:13.823
Tonight?

00:01:14.324 --> 00:01:15.283
Yes.

00:01:15.366 --> 00:01:16.618
Sure, I'll be here.

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:20.205
I mean, not just at night.
I think I'll be home all day.

00:01:24.042 --> 00:01:28.630
If you don't want me to reveal
your dad was laid off and gone missing,

00:01:28.713 --> 00:01:31.466
you'd better listen up
and eat that shiitake mushroom!

00:01:31.549 --> 00:01:33.009
Darn you, Snitch Shroom…

00:01:33.635 --> 00:01:35.804
I hate shiitake mushrooms!

00:01:35.887 --> 00:01:37.305
This is all Dad's fault!

00:01:38.056 --> 00:01:41.226
Darn it! Where are you, Dad?

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:42.894
Hold it right there!

00:01:42.977 --> 00:01:44.145
Hold it right there!

00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:47.607
Snitch Shroom, I shall take you on
as your opponent!

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:50.068
I shall take you on as your opponent!

00:01:50.151 --> 00:01:51.569
There you are, Tonosaman!

00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:54.197
Hehe! I am strong!

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.574
Hehe! I am strong!

00:01:56.658 --> 00:01:58.785
This anime is crazy…

00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:00.870
My name is Tonosaman!

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:02.247
And I am kind to people!

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:04.749
My name is Tonosaman!

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:06.209
It's crazy bad…

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:09.129
Is it worth borrowing
someone else's TV to watch this?

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:11.840
And why is he so glued to it?

00:02:13.341 --> 00:02:14.509
The volume's too loud.

00:02:15.051 --> 00:02:16.636
Turn it down a little.

00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:17.762
It is late at night.

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:20.515
Yes. That's true. Apologies.

00:02:22.559 --> 00:02:24.060
It's a bad habit of mine.

00:02:25.562 --> 00:02:27.397
And you're too close to the TV.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:30.316
You cannot see Tonosaman
because my head's in the way.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.568
Pardon me for that.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:32.986
That's not it!

00:02:33.069 --> 00:02:35.822
You should tidy up the room
a bit more, too.

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:37.240
Shut up.

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:39.117
I clean on days I take out trash.

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:45.999
I was right. It looks like
Tonosaman isn't popular at all.

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:48.501
Why is he so obsessed with it?

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:51.963
Well, he's a bit different after all.

00:02:52.046 --> 00:02:53.256
That feudal lord speech.

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:55.675
So it's from Tonosaman.

00:02:56.301 --> 00:02:58.803
His TV will be delivered tomorrow.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:02.182
I won't need to watch it anymore.

00:03:05.977 --> 00:03:07.896
BATH

00:03:07.979 --> 00:03:10.356
Slash! Slash! Slash!

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:14.986
Super strong and kind,

00:03:15.069 --> 00:03:18.031
Tonosaman.

00:03:18.114 --> 00:03:19.532
He's off-key…

00:03:20.116 --> 00:03:21.951
You really like Tonosaman that much?

00:03:23.077 --> 00:03:25.079
What's so good about that anime?

00:03:25.163 --> 00:03:27.707
The story isn't that great.

00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:31.961
Then you watch it
just because you like that character?

00:03:33.588 --> 00:03:35.006
- Yes.
- We're getting out.

00:03:35.089 --> 00:03:36.466
It's not that per se.

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:39.844
Tonosaman is just special to me.

00:03:39.928 --> 00:03:41.346
Special, huh?

00:03:41.429 --> 00:03:43.598
I don't want go home!

00:03:43.681 --> 00:03:46.267
Stand up, George! We need to leave soon.

00:03:46.351 --> 00:03:48.102
I want to stay here!

00:03:48.186 --> 00:03:49.062
No, we're going!

00:03:49.646 --> 00:03:52.398
But, if you're gonna watch it,
don't you want it to be good?

00:03:52.482 --> 00:03:56.903
I wasn't particularly
watching TV for fun in the beginning.

00:03:57.445 --> 00:03:58.488
What do you mean?

00:03:58.571 --> 00:04:00.281
But you watch TV at night, right?

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:02.075
When I was a kid,

00:04:02.158 --> 00:04:05.453
I was told to go to bed early
and couldn't watch it that late.

00:04:05.536 --> 00:04:07.163
My parents nagged me…

00:04:07.247 --> 00:04:08.373
Oh, shoot…

00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:12.877
Oh no. Did I make him mad?

00:04:12.961 --> 00:04:14.170
C'mon, let's go!

00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:15.880
No! I don't wanna!

00:04:16.881 --> 00:04:17.840
Little boy.

00:04:18.549 --> 00:04:22.136
Even when you say those things,
you have someone always by your side.

00:04:22.887 --> 00:04:24.764
There's nothing to be sad about.

00:04:31.688 --> 00:04:33.398
That little boy is lucky.

00:04:34.649 --> 00:04:35.566
He…

00:04:37.318 --> 00:04:40.613
probably won't need the help of the TV
in the middle of the night.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:47.078
If he has someone, he'll be fine.

00:04:56.838 --> 00:04:59.299
To clarify, things are different now.

00:04:59.382 --> 00:05:00.216
Huh?

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.719
Tonosaman is just a little special to me.

00:05:02.802 --> 00:05:05.763
I don't need the help of the TV anymore.

00:05:06.514 --> 00:05:09.559
I am already an exemplary adult.

00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:11.811
Your long sleeve shirt's on backwards.

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:17.150
I was just testing you.

00:05:17.233 --> 00:05:18.693
Testing me for what?

00:05:25.783 --> 00:05:27.910
I shall go and rescue you now!

00:05:27.994 --> 00:05:30.163
I shall go and rescue you now!

00:05:30.246 --> 00:05:32.874
Next episode! Tonosaman's finale!

00:05:32.957 --> 00:05:35.251
Tonosaman's true identity was his dad!

00:05:35.335 --> 00:05:36.961
Stay tuned!

00:05:37.795 --> 00:05:39.130
Finale?

00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:48.806
Okay, I'm coming.

00:05:49.557 --> 00:05:50.516
Cut it out.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:51.934
Hey…

00:05:53.561 --> 00:05:54.645
What are we gonna do?

00:05:55.355 --> 00:05:56.939
Hello?

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:58.107
What are we gonna do?

00:05:58.191 --> 00:05:59.108
About what?

00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:01.527
It's Tonosaman's finale.

00:06:01.611 --> 00:06:03.112
What are we gonna do about it?

00:06:03.196 --> 00:06:04.238
Huh?

00:06:04.322 --> 00:06:05.865
10 YEN PER TRY

00:06:05.948 --> 00:06:06.908
10 YEN CAN

00:06:10.286 --> 00:06:12.038
Look!

00:06:12.121 --> 00:06:14.582
This little kid
is charging ten yen for something!

00:06:14.665 --> 00:06:15.917
How cute!

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.710
What will you do for us?

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:19.837
Thank you for coming.

00:06:19.921 --> 00:06:21.839
I will do an impression of Tonosaman.

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:23.383
Impression?

00:06:25.843 --> 00:06:29.180
I think Kotaro
is definitely going to feel down.

00:06:29.263 --> 00:06:31.307
You get it, right? Karino…

00:06:31.808 --> 00:06:33.101
Yeah…

00:06:33.184 --> 00:06:34.852
The finale?

00:06:35.478 --> 00:06:38.272
Well, it wasn't that interesting,
so it can't be helped.

00:06:39.148 --> 00:06:43.069
Tonosaman is just special to me.

00:06:45.655 --> 00:06:47.198
Very well.

00:06:47.281 --> 00:06:49.617
You may come closer to me.

00:06:52.245 --> 00:06:53.454
That's it.

00:06:53.538 --> 00:06:55.164
What? Just that?

00:06:55.248 --> 00:06:57.166
So, that's Tonosaman?

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.793
Ten yen for that?

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:03.840
Ten yen, right?

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:06.801
You may accept it.

00:07:06.884 --> 00:07:08.136
You're giving it?

00:07:08.219 --> 00:07:09.470
I'm not giving it to you.

00:07:10.179 --> 00:07:11.806
That low-key hurts.

00:07:11.889 --> 00:07:15.143
I think the way Kotaro talks

00:07:15.226 --> 00:07:18.271
is definitely from Tonosaman.

00:07:18.354 --> 00:07:20.606
That's how much he loves that anime.

00:07:21.441 --> 00:07:22.567
You're right.

00:07:23.151 --> 00:07:25.236
When we watched it together before,

00:07:25.319 --> 00:07:28.072
he was repeating Tonosaman's every line.

00:07:28.156 --> 00:07:30.366
You watched TV with Kotaro? Damn it!

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:32.618
How dare you keep him to yourself!

00:07:32.702 --> 00:07:34.495
You're making me jealous!

00:07:34.579 --> 00:07:36.372
Okay, next time.

00:07:37.957 --> 00:07:39.125
Here is ten yen.

00:07:40.418 --> 00:07:42.003
I have no business with you.

00:07:42.086 --> 00:07:43.337
Haha.

00:07:43.421 --> 00:07:45.590
Okay, you may take this ten yen.

00:08:03.274 --> 00:08:04.984
Ten yen is not adequate.

00:08:08.321 --> 00:08:10.323
Tonosaman is coming up next!

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:17.371
Widdle Kotaro,

00:08:17.455 --> 00:08:19.874
let's watch Tonosaman together!

00:08:20.458 --> 00:08:21.417
Why so suddenly?

00:08:22.043 --> 00:08:24.504
It's the finale of Tonosaman, right?

00:08:24.587 --> 00:08:27.215
I thought your weird feudal language
would end today,

00:08:27.298 --> 00:08:30.343
so we decided to come over and watch.

00:08:32.386 --> 00:08:33.221
I will not stop.

00:08:33.721 --> 00:08:35.431
Even if Tonosaman ends,

00:08:35.515 --> 00:08:37.725
I will speak
in feudal lord language forever.

00:08:37.808 --> 00:08:39.143
Take note of that.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:43.731
Tonosaman! You came to rescue me!

00:08:43.814 --> 00:08:47.068
Yes. Very well. You may come closer to me.

00:08:47.151 --> 00:08:50.947
Yes. Very well. You may come closer to me.

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:53.908
Hey, Karino! Damn it!
Take it more seriously!

00:08:53.991 --> 00:08:55.826
You came up with this idea!

00:08:56.369 --> 00:08:59.205
Well, I'm regretting it a little bit.

00:08:59.288 --> 00:09:01.666
Huh? What did you say?

00:09:01.749 --> 00:09:02.959
First of all, Karino.

00:09:03.042 --> 00:09:05.711
You're too close to widdle Kotaro, okay?

00:09:05.795 --> 00:09:06.963
Can't be helped.

00:09:07.046 --> 00:09:09.966
You can both gift me ten yen.

00:09:10.049 --> 00:09:11.634
Huh? What's that about?

00:09:11.717 --> 00:09:14.470
I don't really get it,
but I'll give it to you.

00:09:20.977 --> 00:09:22.770
Tonosaman is over now,

00:09:23.271 --> 00:09:25.856
but will you be okay at night from now on?

00:09:26.566 --> 00:09:27.650
I told you already.

00:09:27.733 --> 00:09:31.195
I no longer need help from the TV.

00:09:31.696 --> 00:09:32.697
I see.

00:09:42.665 --> 00:09:44.875
Yes. Good night.

00:09:49.213 --> 00:09:50.339
You know…

00:09:51.048 --> 00:09:53.426
should you be going
to the bathhouse every day?

00:09:53.509 --> 00:09:54.594
What do you mean?

00:09:54.677 --> 00:09:56.596
I don't have money.

00:09:56.679 --> 00:09:58.055
I have money.

00:09:58.139 --> 00:10:00.433
Can't you see it from my point of view?

00:10:00.516 --> 00:10:01.767
I never asked you.

00:10:01.851 --> 00:10:04.437
Plus, the bath isn't just a place
to wash your body,

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:07.481
it's a place to wash away
the cares of the day.

00:10:07.565 --> 00:10:09.859
It's essential to have one every day.

00:10:09.942 --> 00:10:11.319
Bathing is important…

00:10:11.402 --> 00:10:13.362
NOTICE OF TEMPORARY CLOSURE
BOILER ISSUE

00:10:13.446 --> 00:10:14.280
FUJI BATH

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.283
It's closed.

00:10:17.366 --> 00:10:19.744
Nothing we can do about a malfunction.

00:10:19.827 --> 00:10:21.704
There are no other bathhouses nearby.

00:10:21.787 --> 00:10:23.414
Forget baths for a few days.

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:25.374
What's wrong?

00:10:26.584 --> 00:10:29.462
THE NEXT DAY

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.258
Good morning to you.

00:10:34.342 --> 00:10:35.384
Morning.

00:10:39.055 --> 00:10:41.223
Why are you just standing there?

00:10:41.307 --> 00:10:44.185
I want to throw away my garbage,
so would you please move?

00:10:44.268 --> 00:10:47.271
Huh? Okay. Go ahead.

00:10:50.858 --> 00:10:52.943
You could throw it away
without me moving…

00:10:53.778 --> 00:10:54.862
What is it?

00:10:54.945 --> 00:10:56.447
What's with you?

00:11:00.785 --> 00:11:02.078
What was that about?

00:11:04.455 --> 00:11:05.956
Morning!

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.083
Good morning.

00:11:07.833 --> 00:11:09.126
Mizuki.

00:11:09.752 --> 00:11:10.961
Have you seen him?

00:11:11.045 --> 00:11:14.048
Kotaro? No, I haven't.

00:11:14.131 --> 00:11:15.299
Did something happen?

00:11:15.383 --> 00:11:17.760
How do I say this…

00:11:17.843 --> 00:11:20.346
He's sort of acting different than usual.

00:11:20.429 --> 00:11:22.181
You sure you're not misreading it?

00:11:22.264 --> 00:11:23.641
That could be it.

00:11:29.522 --> 00:11:31.982
Listen here. You must keep this distance.

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:34.652
Make sure you look ahead when walking.

00:11:35.319 --> 00:11:38.614
I'm keeping my eyes on you
so you don't close the distance.

00:11:38.698 --> 00:11:40.408
He's not making any sense.

00:11:41.242 --> 00:11:43.869
The total is 456 yen.

00:11:46.288 --> 00:11:48.916
Could you grant me my change
on this sword as well?

00:11:49.458 --> 00:11:50.960
What is he doing?

00:11:51.919 --> 00:11:54.463
He's further away than yesterday.

00:11:54.547 --> 00:11:57.341
Listen here. You must keep this distance.

00:11:57.425 --> 00:11:58.426
Yeah, yeah.

00:11:58.509 --> 00:12:02.346
By the way, neighbor,
do you happen to have a smartphone?

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:03.264
Huh?

00:12:05.933 --> 00:12:08.144
Huh? That kid…

00:12:10.563 --> 00:12:11.856
Hello. It's me.

00:12:12.356 --> 00:12:14.692
Where are you right now?

00:12:14.775 --> 00:12:17.361
I left my basket
and money at the cash register.

00:12:17.445 --> 00:12:19.447
Take care of the payment for me.

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:22.908
Here's the stuff you bought
and your change.

00:12:22.992 --> 00:12:23.868
Yes.

00:12:23.951 --> 00:12:25.995
Could you throw the change from there?

00:12:26.078 --> 00:12:27.747
What's up with you?

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:29.123
Since yesterday!

00:12:29.206 --> 00:12:30.374
Do not come any closer!

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:33.753
I have not bathed!

00:12:33.836 --> 00:12:35.129
I am filthy!

00:12:35.212 --> 00:12:36.589
What are you saying?

00:12:36.672 --> 00:12:38.340
I have not bathed in two days!

00:12:38.424 --> 00:12:40.760
It's just two days, don't be dramatic.

00:12:40.843 --> 00:12:42.845
I mean, I haven't bathed either.

00:12:42.928 --> 00:12:46.849
So what if someone
doesn't like you for that?

00:12:50.311 --> 00:12:51.812
I shall go on ahead home.

00:12:51.896 --> 00:12:52.897
Hey, wait!

00:12:53.856 --> 00:12:54.899
Karino.

00:12:55.441 --> 00:12:56.525
You know,

00:12:57.193 --> 00:12:59.862
you should think more
before you speak.

00:13:00.696 --> 00:13:02.364
I see.

00:13:02.448 --> 00:13:05.409
If that was the case,
I'd have let him use my shower.

00:13:05.493 --> 00:13:08.329
This is just a guess, but maybe Kotaro

00:13:08.412 --> 00:13:12.917
had some bad experiences after
not being able to bathe for days?

00:13:13.876 --> 00:13:16.378
He probably doesn't want anyone
to hate him for it.

00:13:16.921 --> 00:13:19.882
I think he's doing what he can
to keep it together.

00:13:25.471 --> 00:13:27.515
Hiya, Kotaro!

00:13:27.598 --> 00:13:30.392
Lady Mizuki. You came at the right time.

00:13:30.476 --> 00:13:31.602
Hear me out.

00:13:31.685 --> 00:13:35.064
I'm currently amid my last resort.

00:13:35.147 --> 00:13:36.315
Last resort?

00:13:36.398 --> 00:13:37.233
Yes.

00:13:37.316 --> 00:13:40.486
Filling the kitchen sink with hot water
is like a bath.

00:13:40.986 --> 00:13:43.030
A good idea, if I do say so myself.

00:13:44.323 --> 00:13:46.116
This way, I can become clean.

00:13:46.742 --> 00:13:49.453
Now my neighbor won't hate me.

00:13:53.249 --> 00:13:55.876
Right! The bathhouse looks like
it'll open tomorrow.

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:59.630
I wouldn't hate you
just because you miss a bath or two.

00:14:00.923 --> 00:14:02.383
Ah well, starting tomorrow,

00:14:02.466 --> 00:14:05.302
I guess I'll go with him
to the bathhouse again everyday.

00:14:08.097 --> 00:14:09.682
By the way, Lady Mizuki,

00:14:09.765 --> 00:14:12.768
would you accompany me
to the bathhouse tomorrow?

00:14:12.852 --> 00:14:15.312
Baths are just better with women.

00:14:15.396 --> 00:14:16.814
That little pervert…

00:14:16.897 --> 00:14:19.066
Thank you for the invite,

00:14:19.149 --> 00:14:21.944
but I have work. Next time, okay?

00:14:22.027 --> 00:14:23.529
That's unfortunate.

00:14:23.612 --> 00:14:25.531
That's what you get.

00:14:46.051 --> 00:14:47.136
Kotaro?

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:50.514
What are you doing so late at night?

00:14:50.598 --> 00:14:52.057
Coming back from work?

00:14:52.141 --> 00:14:53.559
Yeah, I'm back.

00:14:53.642 --> 00:14:55.144
You must be tired.

00:14:56.353 --> 00:14:59.023
By the way, what are you doing
with your pillow?

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:00.733
Sca…

00:15:00.816 --> 00:15:01.734
Sca?

00:15:01.817 --> 00:15:03.861
No, it's nothing.

00:15:03.944 --> 00:15:04.987
Have a good night.

00:15:05.863 --> 00:15:07.281
Good night…

00:15:12.703 --> 00:15:14.997
Are you going to work, Lady Mizuki?

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:16.957
Yep, working hard as usual.

00:15:17.666 --> 00:15:18.626
Under-eye bags…

00:15:22.796 --> 00:15:24.340
Another tough day.

00:15:27.384 --> 00:15:31.472
It's so late,
but Kotaro's light is still on.

00:15:32.848 --> 00:15:33.891
Could it be…

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:42.358
Is it just me, or do you have
bags under your eyes?

00:15:44.568 --> 00:15:45.444
Kotaro!

00:15:46.028 --> 00:15:47.947
Wanna have a sleepover at my place?

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:50.115
I have a day off today.

00:15:50.616 --> 00:15:53.160
I know! Let's go the bathhouse too.

00:15:53.243 --> 00:15:56.288
I only have a shower anyway,
and we can scrub each other!

00:15:56.372 --> 00:15:59.124
Sleepover at Mizuki's? That's nice.

00:15:59.208 --> 00:16:02.378
It would be impolite to refuse
a woman's invitation.

00:16:02.461 --> 00:16:03.963
All right! It's decided!

00:16:19.395 --> 00:16:21.730
Okay, let's go to sleep.

00:16:21.814 --> 00:16:22.648
Yes.

00:16:22.731 --> 00:16:24.858
All right! Let's do arm pillows.

00:16:24.942 --> 00:16:26.777
That's a good idea.

00:16:27.277 --> 00:16:28.112
Oh?

00:16:28.696 --> 00:16:30.030
There. I'm ready.

00:16:30.531 --> 00:16:31.740
So cute!

00:16:33.033 --> 00:16:35.744
- Are you not cold?
- I'm fine.

00:16:35.828 --> 00:16:37.663
Is your arm falling asleep?

00:16:38.455 --> 00:16:39.665
It's not a problem.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.167
Can you sleep?

00:16:43.127 --> 00:16:44.044
I believe so.

00:16:48.757 --> 00:16:51.677
Why are the bags under his eyes worse?

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:53.554
Thank you for last night.

00:16:53.637 --> 00:16:55.556
Not at all. It was fun!

00:16:57.725 --> 00:17:00.894
You haven't done anything weird, have you?

00:17:02.396 --> 00:17:03.772
I guess it didn't work.

00:17:04.398 --> 00:17:06.358
Well, most likely…

00:17:08.444 --> 00:17:11.905
So, I hear that you can't sleep
because of nightmares?

00:17:11.989 --> 00:17:15.451
Mizuki said the same happened to her
when she was little,

00:17:15.534 --> 00:17:18.620
so she thought it might help
if you slept together.

00:17:18.704 --> 00:17:20.247
So, she knew.

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:22.291
As a man, it's quite embarrassing.

00:17:22.833 --> 00:17:24.793
I didn't want to have any nightmares.

00:17:25.335 --> 00:17:26.170
I see.

00:17:26.253 --> 00:17:30.215
Well, I was unable to sleep last night
for other reasons as well.

00:17:30.299 --> 00:17:33.427
My first time letting a woman
sleep on my arm was tough.

00:17:34.845 --> 00:17:37.598
But, it was warm…

00:17:39.349 --> 00:17:41.310
And she smelled good.

00:17:42.853 --> 00:17:44.063
I bet.

00:17:44.146 --> 00:17:49.109
If I go to sleep recalling that scent,
I will likely have a good dream.

00:17:49.693 --> 00:17:52.154
I guess all men are pervs after all…

00:17:55.449 --> 00:17:58.160
It won't make a difference
if I do this or not…

00:18:02.039 --> 00:18:04.208
I'll move this over
and have him sleep here.

00:18:06.752 --> 00:18:12.508
Yesterday, I had such a wonderful dream.
Lady Mizuki made sexy advances towards me.

00:18:12.591 --> 00:18:14.176
I'm putting my futon back.

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:21.558
SHIMIZU KINDERGARTEN
ENTRANCE CEREMONY

00:18:22.351 --> 00:18:26.230
EVERYONE ON A SUNNY DAY/INSPIRATION FROM
CONVENIENCE STORE BENTOS…

00:18:29.066 --> 00:18:30.067
All right.

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:33.153
Please put this name badge on and enter.

00:18:36.156 --> 00:18:37.658
I am Kotaro Sato.

00:18:37.741 --> 00:18:40.452
Oh, huh? Where's your mom and dad?

00:18:40.536 --> 00:18:42.329
I am by myself.

00:18:42.412 --> 00:18:46.083
No big deal. I can handle
a ceremony like this on my own.

00:18:46.166 --> 00:18:48.168
Can you give me the badge quickly, please?

00:18:50.254 --> 00:18:52.047
That kid…

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:56.927
You going somewhere?

00:18:57.678 --> 00:18:58.720
Throwing out trash.

00:18:58.804 --> 00:19:00.597
You aren't holding any trash.

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:02.641
And wearing that hat.

00:19:03.308 --> 00:19:05.060
If you're going out, I'll come with.

00:19:05.144 --> 00:19:06.436
You don't need to come.

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.772
I'm saying it's not safe by yourself--

00:19:08.856 --> 00:19:12.359
I am saying you don't need to come.
This has nothing to do with you.

00:19:12.442 --> 00:19:13.652
You're being a nuisance.

00:19:13.735 --> 00:19:17.239
I'm not saying I'll come along
because I really want to, okay?!

00:19:17.322 --> 00:19:19.616
So, I am saying you don't need to come!

00:19:20.784 --> 00:19:22.619
Come, and I'll slice you in half.

00:19:22.703 --> 00:19:23.620
Huh?

00:19:23.704 --> 00:19:25.247
- Farewell!
- Don't run away!

00:19:26.206 --> 00:19:28.584
He pisses me off. Fine, whatever!

00:19:29.418 --> 00:19:32.671
KOTARO SATO

00:19:42.472 --> 00:19:43.348
Okay.

00:19:44.516 --> 00:19:46.268
This is nothing.

00:19:47.311 --> 00:19:49.980
What? Kotaro isn't here?

00:19:50.063 --> 00:19:52.649
I thought he'd be at your place.

00:19:52.733 --> 00:19:55.444
I wanted to have donuts together.

00:19:55.527 --> 00:19:57.154
Where did Kotaro go?

00:19:57.654 --> 00:19:59.740
I have no idea.

00:19:59.823 --> 00:20:02.075
I said I'd come along, and he ran away.

00:20:02.159 --> 00:20:02.993
Hey!

00:20:03.076 --> 00:20:05.162
Is widdle Kotaro really not here?

00:20:05.245 --> 00:20:06.079
Huh?

00:20:06.163 --> 00:20:10.375
You'd better not be keeping
widdle Kotaro to yourself again!

00:20:10.459 --> 00:20:12.085
I wouldn't do that…

00:20:12.169 --> 00:20:13.378
Oh no!

00:20:13.462 --> 00:20:16.006
Hurry! We'll be late
for the entrance ceremony!

00:20:16.089 --> 00:20:18.008
That hat…

00:20:21.637 --> 00:20:22.721
Entrance ceremony?

00:20:23.889 --> 00:20:24.890
Hey, you.

00:20:25.891 --> 00:20:27.476
Why are you alone?

00:20:27.559 --> 00:20:30.270
Everyone has their mommy and daddy.

00:20:30.354 --> 00:20:31.355
You're weird.

00:20:32.856 --> 00:20:33.690
They are here.

00:20:33.774 --> 00:20:35.484
What? They aren't.

00:20:35.567 --> 00:20:38.362
You can't see them, they're next to me.

00:20:38.445 --> 00:20:39.446
What?!

00:20:39.529 --> 00:20:41.823
Because my parents are ninjas.

00:20:41.907 --> 00:20:42.991
Really?!

00:20:43.075 --> 00:20:46.161
They are hiding themselves
with camouflage.

00:20:46.245 --> 00:20:47.913
That's cool!

00:20:47.996 --> 00:20:49.373
So, this is fine.

00:20:50.999 --> 00:20:52.125
This is just fine.

00:20:55.879 --> 00:20:58.465
Pardon me, but who might you all be?

00:20:58.548 --> 00:21:00.759
Is Kotaro Sato here?

00:21:00.842 --> 00:21:03.303
Oh, yes. Kotaro!

00:21:03.387 --> 00:21:05.931
I'm glad. Are you his guardians?

00:21:06.014 --> 00:21:06.974
- Mother.
- Father.

00:21:07.599 --> 00:21:08.433
Huh?

00:21:08.976 --> 00:21:11.103
Seems like a complicated family…

00:21:14.356 --> 00:21:17.401
It really is widdle Kotaro's
entrance ceremony!

00:21:17.484 --> 00:21:19.528
Why'd you let him go by himself?

00:21:19.611 --> 00:21:24.491
If you think about it, Kotaro's about the
age of a preschooler or kindergartner.

00:21:24.574 --> 00:21:28.495
An entrance ceremony? Of course,
other kids would have parents there.

00:21:29.037 --> 00:21:31.248
Kotaro must be lonely.

00:21:32.749 --> 00:21:36.420
I'm not saying I'll come along
because I really want to, okay?!

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:39.923
And I am saying that
you don't need to come!

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:42.968
Seriously…

00:21:43.051 --> 00:21:44.386
He seriously ticks me off!

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:56.440
There's no need
for a kid to show restraint!

00:22:02.029 --> 00:22:03.989
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:22:04.865 --> 00:22:06.241
Is that so?

00:22:07.617 --> 00:22:10.454
Why are you sitting next to him
like it's your seat?

00:22:10.537 --> 00:22:13.623
Kotaro, let's eat donuts together later!

00:22:16.918 --> 00:22:17.753
My badge…

00:22:20.422 --> 00:22:22.507
I can't put my badge on very well.

00:22:23.133 --> 00:22:24.760
Could someone put it on for me?

00:22:27.637 --> 00:22:29.681
No need to blush.

00:22:29.765 --> 00:22:30.932
I'm not blushing!

00:22:31.933 --> 00:22:33.143
How cute!

00:22:33.226 --> 00:22:35.103
Can I nuzzle you?

00:22:35.187 --> 00:22:36.521
I refuse.

00:22:44.529 --> 00:22:46.907
SHIMIZU CONVENIENCE STORE

00:22:46.990 --> 00:22:48.075
SHIMIZU KINDERGARTEN

00:22:48.158 --> 00:22:51.578
EVERY WEDNESDAY IS BENTO DAY!
GUARDIANS, PLEASE MAKE THEM IF POSSIBLE

00:22:53.038 --> 00:22:54.998
Now, it's time to fill my bento box.

00:22:55.499 --> 00:22:58.293
Okay, everybody. Put your hands together.

00:22:58.377 --> 00:23:00.128
Let's eat!

00:23:02.172 --> 00:23:04.132
All right, let us eat.

00:23:05.425 --> 00:23:07.594
There's a bear in your bento!

00:23:07.677 --> 00:23:09.721
Mommy made it for me!

00:23:10.222 --> 00:23:12.766
My mommy made me a train!

00:23:13.392 --> 00:23:15.102
Kotaro's bento is normal.

00:23:15.185 --> 00:23:18.688
This is a ninja bento
that my ninja mother made for me.

00:23:18.772 --> 00:23:20.565
What? That's so cool!

00:23:21.066 --> 00:23:21.900
Sir Takuya,

00:23:22.401 --> 00:23:25.946
may I take a picture of your bento?

00:23:26.029 --> 00:23:28.323
You're not supposed to bring that.

00:23:28.407 --> 00:23:30.575
Keep this a secret from the teacher.

00:23:31.118 --> 00:23:33.495
NEXT WEDNESDAY

00:23:34.246 --> 00:23:35.956
Thank you very much.

00:23:36.665 --> 00:23:38.500
Yes. This will do.

00:23:41.002 --> 00:23:44.589
That's amazing.
Did you make that yourself?

00:23:44.673 --> 00:23:47.175
Yes. It is a Tonosaman bento.

00:23:48.260 --> 00:23:50.011
Let's eat!

00:23:50.095 --> 00:23:53.557
Your bento looks good, Kotaro.
It's so cool!

00:23:53.640 --> 00:23:55.934
Yes. It's a Tonosaman bento.

00:23:56.810 --> 00:23:57.686
You're right!

00:24:01.231 --> 00:24:03.817
Yes. This will do.

00:24:06.111 --> 00:24:07.988
How was today's bento?

00:24:08.071 --> 00:24:10.240
It was really good!

00:24:10.323 --> 00:24:12.159
Oh good. I'm glad!

00:24:12.242 --> 00:24:14.035
Next time, I want a cat!

00:24:14.119 --> 00:24:16.329
Okay, let's think about it together.

00:24:16.413 --> 00:24:17.247
Yeah!

00:24:18.081 --> 00:24:20.459
THE FOLLOWING WEDNESDAY AFTER THAT

00:24:24.588 --> 00:24:25.964
Do you have a minute?

00:24:26.047 --> 00:24:27.007
Huh?

00:24:27.090 --> 00:24:29.301
I'd like to make
a so-called character bento,

00:24:29.384 --> 00:24:30.510
but I'm having trouble.

00:24:30.594 --> 00:24:33.513
So, could you give me some good ideas?

00:24:33.597 --> 00:24:34.806
Ideas?

00:24:44.774 --> 00:24:47.486
How about you use
a cherry tomato for the nose?

00:24:47.569 --> 00:24:50.697
Okay, Ms. Office Worker.
Could you put the cherry tomato on it?

00:24:50.780 --> 00:24:53.241
It'll be more colorful with an egg.

00:24:53.325 --> 00:24:56.077
Okay, please put the boiled egg on it.

00:24:56.161 --> 00:24:58.371
Use seaweed or seasoning for the clothes.

00:24:58.455 --> 00:24:59.831
Please go ahead.

00:24:59.915 --> 00:25:02.501
I think a meatball would work here.

00:25:02.584 --> 00:25:04.711
I see, I'll leave it up to you.

00:25:04.794 --> 00:25:07.547
He made it by himself last time.

00:25:07.631 --> 00:25:08.548
What happened?

00:25:13.220 --> 00:25:16.139
Today's bento is
a little weirder than before.

00:25:16.223 --> 00:25:18.475
You are still a child.

00:25:18.558 --> 00:25:23.230
This bento is on a different level
than the ones before.

00:25:26.483 --> 00:25:29.236
The cat bento was really good, too!

00:25:29.319 --> 00:25:30.987
Thank you for making it!

00:25:31.071 --> 00:25:32.155
Of course.

00:25:36.993 --> 00:25:38.245
What's the matter?

00:25:40.247 --> 00:25:44.084
I wanted to say thank you to everyone
who gave me ideas today.

00:25:44.918 --> 00:25:46.836
Therefore, I shall be waiting here.

00:25:47.337 --> 00:25:50.423
I see! I hope everyone comes back soon!

00:25:51.007 --> 00:25:51.841
Yes!

00:26:51.151 --> 00:26:53.903
Subtitle translation by: Paul Koehler
